  ["Seer Pathway: Interpret the revelations, revere fate."] = "Vidente Caminho : Interprete as revelações, reverencie o destino.",
  ["Seer skills cause additional effects based on the number of Card stacks. \nSkills that can stack Cards: Not Fiction, Fate Tarot, Fancy Card Throwing. \nSkills that gain additional effects based on Card stacks: Miracle Card Rain, Flame Jump, Curtain Call, Card Flying Dagger, spirit body threads, Marionettist."] = "As habilidades de vidente causam efeitos adicionais com base no número de pilhas de cartas. \nHabilidades que podem empilhar cartas: Not Fiction, Fate Tarot, Fancy Card Throwing. \nHabilidades que ganham efeitos adicionais com base nas pilhas de cartas: Miracle Card Rain, Flame Jump, Curtain Call, Card Flying Dagger, corpo espiritual threads, Marionettist.",
