  ["When receiving attacks from an Apprentice Pathway Beyonder, negates {*d,F1690001,ApprenticeHurtReduce} points of their Special Attack. (Reduces the attacker's Special Attack to a maximum of 0)"] = "Ao receber ataques de um Aprendiz Caminho Beyonder , nega {*d,F1690001,ApprenticeHurtReduce} pontos de seu Ataque Especial. (Reduz o Ataque Especial do atacante a um máximo de 0)",
  ["Under Guard, Skill Block increased <Yellow>*d</>."] = "Sob guarda, bloqueio de habilidade aumentou <Yellow> *d </> .",
