  ["Base Liquor: \n● Icefield Rye Whiskey (Feysac Specialty) — 3 parts \n● High-Purity Snow Ridge Distilled Spirit — 2 parts \nSpices and Herbs: \n● Tundra Juniper Berries — A small handful (approx. 12 berries) \n● Far North Moss Infusion — A few drops \n● Frost Mint Leaves — 3 leaves \n● Smoked Oak Charcoal Chips — A pinch \nSecret Additions: \n● Honey Syrup (to neutralize the harshness) — Half a spoonful \n● Melted Snow Water — A moderate amount"] = "Licor base: \n● Icefield Rye Whisky (Especialidade Feysac) - 3 partes \n● Snow Ridge Destilado Spirit de alta pureza - 2 partes \nEspeciarias e ervas: \n● Tundra Juniper Berries - Um punhado pequeno (aproximadamente 12 frutas) \n● Far North Moss Infusion - Algumas gotas \n● Frost Mint Folhas — 3 folhas \n ● Lascas de carvão de carvalho defumado — Uma pitada \n Adições secretas: \n ● Xarope de mel (para neutralizar a aspereza) — Meia colher \n ● Água de neve derretida — Uma quantidade moderada",
